  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Based Violence: Youth for Change (Phase 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To address the problem that young people do not feel empowered enough to combat Gender Based Violence (GBV), and often lack the necessary skills to do so. Despite being disproportionately affected by GBV, young people do not have meaningful access to (or representation in) spaces of influence.</narrative>
  </description>
